---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, "");
---

<BaseLayout mode="grid" current="home">
  <div class="home-shell">
    <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">EXPERIMENTAL AUDIOVISUAL FORMAT</p>
        <h1 id="hero-title">Avelune</h1>
        <p class="hero-summary">An experimental audiovisual codec family and indexed streaming container, specified before it is optimized.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="button-link" href={`${base}/spec/`}>Read specification</a>
          <a class="text-link" href={`${base}/demo/`}>Try browser demo&nbsp; →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="technical-profile" aria-label="Avelune technical profile">
        <div class="profile-head"><span>FORMAT PROFILE</span><span class="unfrozen">UNFROZEN</span></div>
        <div class="plane-map" aria-label="Planar 4:2:0 luma and chroma structure">
          <div class="plane plane-y"><span>Y′</span><small>8 BIT · FULL</small></div>
          <div class="plane plane-cb"><span>Cb</span><small>½ × ½</small></div>
          <div class="plane plane-cr"><span>Cr</span><small>½ × ½</small></div>
        </div>
        <dl>
          <div><dt>VIDEO</dt><dd><code>ALV1</code> · planar 4:2:0</dd></div>
          <div><dt>AUDIO</dt><dd><code>ALA1</code> · lifting wavelet</dd></div>
          <div><dt>CONTAINER</dt><dd><code>AVL</code> · front-indexed epochs</dd></div>
          <div><dt>STATE</dt><dd>Research / proof of concept</dd></div>
        </dl>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="registry" aria-labelledby="registry-title">
      <header><p class="eyebrow">DRAFT GENERATION 1</p><h2 id="registry-title">Format registry</h2></header>
      <div class="registry-row">
        <a href={`${base}/spec/video/alv1/`}><strong>ALV1</strong><span>video bitstream</span><small>LOSSY / LOSSLESS</small></a>
        <a href={`${base}/spec/audio/ala1/`}><strong>ALA1</strong><span>audio bitstream</span><small>LOSSY / LOSSLESS</small></a>
        <a href={`${base}/spec/container/avl/`}><strong>AVL</strong><span>stream container</span><small>RANGE / EPOCH INDEX</small></a>
      </div>
      <p class="registry-note">Format identifiers describe the current draft generation, not a stable compatibility promise.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="architecture" aria-labelledby="architecture-title">
      <header><p class="eyebrow">SYSTEM MODEL</p><h2 id="architecture-title">Designed for bounded, indexed playback</h2></header>
      <svg viewBox="0 0 940 300" role="img" aria-labelledby="diagram-title diagram-description">
        <title id="diagram-title">Avelune container and decoding architecture</title>
        <desc id="diagram-description">A front index addresses independent epochs containing audio and video packets. Decoders reconstruct media for presentation.</desc>
        <g class="diagram-rules"><path d="M120 65H340M470 65H690M205 220H430M510 220H735"/><path d="M340 65l-10-6v12zm350 0l-10-6v12zM430 220l-10-6v12zm305 0l-10-6v12z"/></g>
        <g class="diagram-box"><rect x="15" y="25" width="105" height="80"/><rect x="340" y="25" width="130" height="80"/><rect x="690" y="25" width="145" height="80"/><rect x="100" y="180" width="105" height="80"/><rect x="430" y="180" width="80" height="80"/><rect x="735" y="180" width="135" height="80"/></g>
        <g class="diagram-label"><text x="32" y="58">FRONT</text><text x="32" y="80">INDEX</text><text x="360" y="58">EPOCH</text><text x="360" y="80">RANGES</text><text x="712" y="58">PACKETS</text><text x="712" y="80">ALV1 / ALA1</text><text x="119" y="213">RANGE</text><text x="119" y="235">FETCH</text><text x="445" y="213">WASM</text><text x="445" y="235">DECODE</text><text x="756" y="213">Y′CbCr</text><text x="756" y="235">+ PCM</text></g>
        <path class="diagram-link" d="M52 105v55h100v20M405 105v38H152v37M762 105v38H790v37"/>
      </svg>
      <div class="architecture-copy"><p>The container’s CRC-protected front index identifies independently fetchable epochs. The browser demo requests byte ranges, decodes the project’s own bitstreams in WebAssembly, and presents Y′CbCr frames with WebGPU or Canvas2D.</p><a href={`${base}/docs/browser/streaming-contract/`}>Read the streaming contract →</a></div>
    </section>

    <section class="status-strip" aria-label="Project status">
      <div><span>IMPLEMENTATION</span><strong>Safe Rust reference crates</strong></div>
      <div><span>CONFORMANCE</span><strong>Differential decoder checks</strong></div>
      <div><span>LIMIT</span><strong>Not production-performance</strong></div>
      <a href={`${base}/project/status/`}>Full project status →</a>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  @layer page {
    .home-shell { width: min(calc(100% - 2rem), var(--shell)); margin-inline: auto; }
    .hero { min-height: min(720px, calc(100vh - 56px)); display: grid; grid-template-columns: 7fr 5fr; gap: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 7rem); align-items: center; padding: 5rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule); }
    .hero-copy h1 { margin: .45rem 0 1rem; }
    .hero-summary { max-width: 590px; margin: 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: clamp(1.15rem, 2.2vw, 1.45rem); line-height: 1.5; }
    .hero-actions { display: flex; gap: 1.5rem; align-items: center; margin-top: 2.25rem; }
    .technical-profile { align-self: center; border-block: 1px solid var(--rule); }
    .profile-head { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; padding: .65rem 0; color: var(--muted); font: .68rem/1.4 var(--font-mono); letter-spacing: .08em; }
    .unfrozen { color: var(--warm); }
    .plane-map { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr; grid-template-rows: 1fr 1fr; min-height: 245px; border: 1px solid var(--rule); }
    .plane { display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; padding: .75rem; font-family: var(--font-mono); }
    .plane span { font-size: 1.2rem; }
    .plane small { font-size: .62rem; letter-spacing: .08em; }
    .plane-y { grid-row: 1 / 3; color: var(--luma); background: linear-gradient(135deg, color-mix(in srgb, var(--luma) 12%, transparent), transparent); }
    .plane-cb { border-left: 1px solid var(--rule); color: var(--cool); background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--cool) 8%, transparent); }
    .plane-cr { border-top: 1px solid var(--rule); border-left: 1px solid var(--rule); color: var(--warm); background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--warm) 8%, transparent); }
    .technical-profile dl { margin: 0; }
    .technical-profile dl div { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 6.5rem 1fr; padding: .6rem 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--rule); }
    .technical-profile dt { color: var(--muted); font: .65rem/1.6 var(--font-mono); }
    .technical-profile dd { margin: 0; font-size: .83rem; }
    .registry, .architecture { padding: 6rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule); }
    .registry header, .architecture header { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 3fr; align-items: baseline; }
    .registry h2, .architecture h2 { margin: 0 0 2.3rem; max-width: 22ch; }
    .registry-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); border-block: 1px solid var(--rule); }
    .registry-row a { display: grid; grid-template-columns: auto 1fr; gap: .2rem 1rem; padding: 1.4rem 1.5rem; color: var(--ink); text-decoration: none; }
    .registry-row a + a { border-left: 1px solid var(--rule); }
    .registry-row strong { grid-row: 1 / 3; color: var(--cool); font: 1.1rem/1.5 var(--font-mono); }
    .registry-row span { font-weight: 500; }
    .registry-row small { color: var(--muted); font: .62rem/1.4 var(--font-mono); letter-spacing: .06em; }
    .registry-note { color: var(--muted); font-size: .85rem; }
    .architecture svg { width: 100%; padding: 1.5rem 0; border-block: 1px solid var(--rule); }
    .diagram-box rect { fill: var(--surface); stroke: var(--rule); }
    .diagram-rules, .diagram-link { fill: var(--cool); stroke: var(--cool); stroke-width: 1; }
    .diagram-link { fill: none; stroke: var(--warm); stroke-dasharray: 3 5; }
    .diagram-label { fill: var(--ink); font: 12px var(--font-mono); }
    .architecture-copy { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr; gap: 4rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; color: var(--muted); }
    .architecture-copy p { max-width: 66ch; margin: 0; }
    .status-strip { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr) auto; gap: 2rem; align-items: end; padding: 2rem 0; }
    .status-strip div { display: grid; gap: .3rem; }
    .status-strip span { color: var(--muted); font: .62rem/1.4 var(--font-mono); }
    .status-strip strong { font-size: .82rem; font-weight: 500; }
    .status-strip a { font-size: .8rem; }
    @media (max-width: 800px) {
      .hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr; min-height: auto; padding: 4rem 0; }
      .technical-profile { width: 100%; }
      .registry header, .architecture header { display: block; }
      .registry-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .registry-row a + a { border-left: 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--rule); }
      .architecture-copy, .status-strip { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 1.2rem; }
    }
    @media (max-width: 480px) { .hero-actions { align-items: stretch; flex-direction: column; } .registry, .architecture { padding: 4rem 0; } }
  }
</style>
